265"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-11T18:50:09-07:00","id":864028,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/833213-entitlements-2e?p=833354#post833354\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">They are handled like precious eggs traversing the wild mountain range in the paws of a caring panda.<br /> <br /> THey are in the book, as it turns out. I was wrong, mah bad.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> That's good. I feel that writing about them, saving the description to a word document, and then printing it along with the rest of the text when the time comes will be loads more efficient than that first thing you mentioned. Albeit less adorable. Then again, I don't think that's actually a thing that pandas do. Could be wrong.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2244-nothri","name":"nothri","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"485"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-09T11:09:48-07:00","id":984502,"title":"","content":"So <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Seeing as we have finally been given 2E Updates on how to build (or convert) Entitlements, anyone have ideas to share?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/806810-deionscribe-s-homebrew-hub#post806810\" target=\"_blank\">&quot;My Homebrew Hub&quot;</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/828132-open-invite-age-of-azar\" target=\"_blank\">Age of Azar</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/907224-the-kingdom-of-yamatai-dark-era\" target=\"_blank\">The Kingdom of Yamatai</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8180-deionscribe","name":"Deionscribe","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2265"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-09T12:45:55-07:00","id":984556,"title":"","content":"Well seeing as I suggested that the Clarity requirement and benifits from the 1e version of Lost Pantheon gets changed to focusing on the Delusional Condition instead of its less swingy and so the changes to clarity don't become a problem.<br /> <br /> &quot; Like okay how about this for requirements Wyrd 6+, Peristant Delusion Condition, Mantle 5.<br /> <br /> Benifits: +2 to all die rolls to fight, resist, and deal with the True Fae and they're servants, \u2022 Long of Days Merit, the penalties of the Delusion condition instead become bonuses, and they can Harvest Glamour from acts of mortals worshipping them as long as they're true form is revealed, using a Presence + Occult roll, treat the results as if it was they're court emotion.<br /> <br /> Approach: The Ancients enjoy divine rivalries, to do the approach, treat them as a divine rival, undermine the faith of their worshippers, challenge them to prove their godhood and then insure they fail said challenges.&quot;<br /> <br /> And I found the Vizer reference you made, they replace a focus on contracts, with one on goblin vows. I think Vizers requirements in 2e would be high enough to warrant both, because I realized for immortality, all they need is a free long of days \u2022 Merit, like I suggested for the Lost Pantheon.<br /> <br /> Of course maybe the Lost Pantheon will be converted into a court or the unique court contract for the Ivory Court, who knows.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-09T18:09:49-07:00","id":984692,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/833213-entitlements-2e?p=984556#post984556\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Of course maybe the Lost Pantheon will be converted into a court or the unique court contract for the Ivory Court, who knows.</div> </div> </div> </div>Maybe. I'd like to see how other people convert them, though. Anyway, here's my conversion for [URL=&quot;http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/984680-the-barony-of-the-lesser-ones-2e&quot;]the Barony of the Lesser Ones[URL].","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/